msgid "Use global"
msgstr "Koristi globalna pravila"

#: jspolicies.cpp:170 jspolicies.cpp:224 jspolicies.cpp:261 jspolicies.cpp:298
#: jspolicies.cpp:338
#, kde-format
msgid "Use setting from global policy."
msgstr "Koristi postavku iz globalnih pravila."

#: jspolicies.cpp:176 jspolicies.cpp:230 jspolicies.cpp:267 jspolicies.cpp:304
#: jspolicies.cpp:344
#, kde-format
msgid "Allow"
msgstr "Dopusti"

#: jspolicies.cpp:177
#, kde-format
msgid "Accept all popup window requests."
msgstr "Prihvati sve zahtjeve za otvaranje skočnih prozora."

#: jspolicies.cpp:183
#, kde-format
msgid "Prompt every time a popup window is requested."
msgstr "Prikaži upit pri svakom zahtjevu za otvaranje skočnog prozora."

#: jspolicies.cpp:188
#, kde-format
msgid "Deny"
msgstr "Odbij"

#: jspolicies.cpp:189
#, kde-format
msgid "Reject all popup window requests."
msgstr "Odbij sve zahtjeve za otvaranje skočnih prozora."

#: jspolicies.cpp:194
#, kde-format
msgid "Smart"
msgstr "Pametno"

#: jspolicies.cpp:195
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Accept popup window requests only when links are activated through an "
"explicit mouse click or keyboard operation."
msgstr "Prihvati zahtjeve za otvaranje skočnih prozora samo kada se poveznice aktiviraju izričitim klikom miša ili radnjom tipkovnice."

#: jspolicies.cpp:202
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"If you disable this, Konqueror will stop interpreting the <i>window.open()</"
"i> JavaScript command. This is useful if you regularly visit sites that make "
"extensive use of this command to pop up ad banners.<br /><br /><b>Note:</b> "
"Disabling this option might also break certain sites that require <i>window."
"open()</i> for proper operation. Use this feature carefully."
msgstr "Ako ovo onemogućite, Konqueror će prestati tumačiti JavaScriptovu naredbu <i>window.open()</i>. To je korisno ako redovito posjećujete stranice koje tu naredbu intenzivno koriste za prikaz oglasnih bannera.<br /><br /><b>Napomena:</b> onemogućivanje ove mogućnosti može poremetiti rad nekih stranica kojima je <i>window.open()</i> potreban za ispravan rad. Ovu značajku koristite oprezno."

#: jspolicies.cpp:216
#, kde-format
msgid "Resize window:"
msgstr "Promjena veličine prozora:"

#: jspolicies.cpp:231
#, kde-format
msgid "Allow scripts to change the window size."
msgstr "Dopusti skriptama promjenu veličine prozora."

#: jspolicies.cpp:236 jspolicies.cpp:273 jspolicies.cpp:310 jspolicies.cpp:350
#, kde-format
msgid "Ignore"
msgstr "Zanemari"

#: jspolicies.cpp:237
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Ignore attempts of scripts to change the window size. The web page will "
"<i>think</i> it changed the size but the actual window is not affected."
msgstr "Zanemari pokušaje skripti da promijene veličinu prozora. Web-stranica će <i>misliti</i> da je promijenila veličinu, ali stvarni prozor neće se promijeniti."

#: jspolicies.cpp:244
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Some websites change the window size on their own by using <i>window."
"resizeBy()</i> or <i>window.resizeTo()</i>. This option specifies the "
"treatment of such attempts."
msgstr "Neke web-stranice samostalno mijenjaju veličinu prozora pomoću funkcija <i>window.resizeBy()</i> ili <i>window.resizeTo()</i>. Ova mogućnost određuje kako će se postupati s takvim pokušajima."

#: jspolicies.cpp:253
#, kde-format
msgid "Move window:"
msgstr "Pomicanje prozora:"

#: jspolicies.cpp:268
#, kde-format
msgid "Allow scripts to change the window position."
msgstr "Dopusti skriptama promjenu položaja prozora."

#: jspolicies.cpp:274
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Ignore attempts of scripts to change the window position. The web page will "
"<i>think</i> it moved the window but the actual position is not affected."
msgstr "Zanemari pokušaje skripti da promijene položaj prozora. Web-stranica će <i>misliti</i> da je pomaknula prozor, ali njegov se stvarni položaj neće promijeniti."

#: jspolicies.cpp:281
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Some websites change the window position on their own by using <i>window."
"moveBy()</i> or <i>window.moveTo()</i>. This option specifies the treatment "
"of such attempts."
msgstr "Neke web-stranice samostalno mijenjaju položaj prozora pomoću funkcija <i>window.moveBy()</i> ili <i>window.moveTo()</i>. Ova mogućnost određuje kako će se postupati s takvim pokušajima."

#: jspolicies.cpp:290
#, kde-format
msgid "Focus window:"
msgstr "Fokusiranje prozora:"

#: jspolicies.cpp:305
#, kde-format
msgid "Allow scripts to focus the window."
msgstr "Dopusti skriptama da fokusiraju prozor."

#: jspolicies.cpp:311
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Ignore attempts of scripts to focus the window. The web page will <i>think</"
"i> it brought the focus to the window but the actual focus will remain "
"unchanged."
msgstr "Zanemari pokušaje skripti da fokusiraju prozor. Web-stranica će <i>misliti</i> da je prozor dobio fokus, ali će stvarni fokus ostati nepromijenjen."

#: jspolicies.cpp:319
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Some websites set the focus to their browser window on their own by using "
"<i>window.focus()</i>. This usually leads to the window being moved to the "
"front interrupting whatever action the user was dedicated to at that time. "
"This option specifies the treatment of such attempts."
msgstr "Neke web-stranice samostalno fokusiraju svoj prozor preglednika pomoću funkcije <i>window.focus()</i>. Zbog toga se prozor obično premješta u prvi plan i prekida radnju koju je korisnik obavljao. Ova mogućnost određuje kako će se postupati s takvim pokušajima."

#: jspolicies.cpp:330
#, kde-format
msgid "Modify status bar text:"
msgstr "Promjena teksta trake stanja:"

#: jspolicies.cpp:345
#, kde-format
msgid "Allow scripts to change the text of the status bar."
msgstr "Dopusti skriptama promjenu teksta trake stanja."

#: jspolicies.cpp:351
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Ignore attempts of scripts to change the status bar text. The web page will "
"<i>think</i> it changed the text but the actual text will remain unchanged."
msgstr "Zanemari pokušaje skripti da promijene tekst trake stanja. Web-stranica će <i>misliti</i> da je promijenila tekst, ali će stvarni tekst ostati nepromijenjen."

#: jspolicies.cpp:359
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Some websites change the status bar text by setting <i>window.status</i> or "
"<i>window.defaultStatus</i>, thus sometimes preventing displaying the real "
"URLs of hyperlinks. This option specifies the treatment of such attempts."
msgstr "Neke web-stranice mijenjaju tekst trake stanja postavljanjem vrijednosti <i>window.status</i> ili <i>window.defaultStatus</i>, čime ponekad sprječavaju prikaz stvarnih URL-ova hiperpoveznica. Ova mogućnost određuje kako će se postupati s takvim pokušajima."

#: policydlg.cpp:30
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@title:window"
msgid "Domain-Specific Policies"
msgstr "Pravila specifična za domenu"

#: policydlg.cpp:47
#, kde-format
msgid "&Host or domain name:"
msgstr "Naziv &računala ili domene:"

#: policydlg.cpp:55
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Enter the name of a host (like www.kde.org) or a domain, starting with a dot "
"(like .kde.org or .org)"
msgstr "Unesite naziv računala (npr. www.kde.org) ili domene koja počinje točkom (npr. .kde.org ili .org)"

#: policydlg.cpp:139
#, kde-format
msgid "You must first enter a domain name."
msgstr "Najprije morate unijeti naziv domene."

#. i18n: ectx: property (windowTitle), widget (QWidget, TabsOptions)
#: tabs/tabsoptions.ui:14
#, kde-format
msgid "Tabs Behavior"
msgstr "Ponašanje kartica"

#. i18n: ectx: property (title), widget (QGroupBox, groupBox_4)
#: tabs/tabsoptions.ui:20
#, kde-format
msgid "Aspect"
msgstr "Izgled"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, m_pDynamicTabbarHide)
#: tabs/tabsoptions.ui:26
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"This will display the tab bar only if there are two or more tabs. Otherwise "
"it will always be displayed."
msgstr "Traka kartica prikazivat će se samo ako postoje dvije ili više kartica. U suprotnom će uvijek biti prikazana."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, m_pDynamicTabbarHide)
#: tabs/tabsoptions.ui:29
#, kde-format
msgid "Hide the tab bar when only one tab is open"
msgstr "Sakrij traku kartica kada je otvorena samo jedna kartica"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, label)
#: tabs/tabsoptions.ui:38
#, kde-format
msgid "Tab bar position"
msgstr "Položaj trake kartica"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QComboBox, tabbarPosition)
#: tabs/tabsoptions.ui:48
#, kde-format
msgid "Choose where to display the tabs bar"
msgstr "Odaberite gdje će se prikazivati traka kartica"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), item, widget (QComboBox, tabbarPosition)
#: tabs/tabsoptions.ui:52
#, kde-format
msgid "Above contents"
msgstr "Iznad sadržaja"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), item, widget (QComboBox, tabbarPosition)
#: tabs/tabsoptions.ui:57
#, kde-format
msgid "Below contents"
msgstr "Ispod sadržaja"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), item, widget (QComboBox, tabbarPosition)
#: tabs/tabsoptions.ui:62
#, kde-format
msgid "Left of contents"
msgstr "Lijevo od sadržaja"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), item, widget (QComboBox, tabbarPosition)
#: tabs/tabsoptions.ui:67
#, kde-format
msgid "Right of contents"
msgstr "Desno od sadržaja"

#. i18n: ectx: property (title), widget (QGroupBox, groupBox)
#: tabs/tabsoptions.ui:93
#, kde-format
msgid "Usage"
msgstr "Uporaba"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, m_pShowMMBInTabs)
#: tabs/tabsoptions.ui:99
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"This will open a new tab instead of a new window in various situations, such "
"as choosing a link or a folder with the middle mouse button."
msgstr "U raznim će se situacijama otvoriti nova kartica umjesto novog prozora, primjerice pri odabiru poveznice ili mape srednjom tipkom miša."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, m_pShowMMBInTabs)
#: tabs/tabsoptions.ui:102
#, kde-format
msgid "Open &links in new tab instead of in new window"
msgstr "Otvori &poveznice u novoj kartici umjesto u novom prozoru"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, m_pPopupsWithinTabs)
#: tabs/tabsoptions.ui:109
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Whether or not JavaScript popups if allowed shall open in a new tab or in a "
"new window."
msgstr "Određuje hoće li se dopušteni JavaScriptovi skočni prozori otvarati u novoj kartici ili novom prozoru."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, m_pPopupsWithinTabs)
#: tabs/tabsoptions.ui:112
#, kde-format
msgid "Open pop&ups in new tab instead of in new window"
msgstr "Otvori skočne prozore u novoj kartici umjesto u novom prozoru"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, m_pKonquerorTabforExternalURL)
#: tabs/tabsoptions.ui:119
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"When you click a URL in another KDE program or call kfmclient to open a URL, "
"the current desktop will be searched for a non-minimized Konqueror and, if "
"found, the URL opened as a new tab within it. Otherwise a new Konqueror "
"window will be opened with the required URL."
msgstr "Kada kliknete URL u drugom KDE-ovu programu ili pozovete kfmclient da otvori URL, na trenutačnoj radnoj površini potražit će se minimizirani Konqueror i, ako se pronađe, URL će se otvoriti kao nova kartica u njemu. U suprotnom će se otvoriti novi prozor Konquerora sa zatraženim URL-om."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, m_pKonquerorTabforExternalURL)
#: tabs/tabsoptions.ui:122
#, kde-format
msgid "Open as tab in existing Konqueror when URL is called externally"
msgstr "Otvori u kartici postojećeg Konquerora kada se URL pozove izvana"

#. i18n: ectx: property (title), widget (QGroupBox, groupBox_2)
#: tabs/tabsoptions.ui:132
#, kde-format
msgid "New Tab Behavior"
msgstr "Ponašanje nove kartice"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, m_pNewTabsInBackground)
#: tabs/tabsoptions.ui:138
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<html><head/><body><p>This will open a new tab in the background, instead of "
"in the foreground.</p><p>Press <span style=\" font-family:'Fira Code';"
"\">shift</span> when opening a new tab to reverse this behavior</p></body></"
"html>"
msgstr "<html><head/><body><p>Nova će se kartica otvoriti u pozadini, a ne u prvom planu.</p><p>Pri otvaranju nove kartice pritisnite <span style=\" font-family:'Fira Code';\">shift</span> kako biste preokrenuli ovo ponašanje.</p></body></html>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, m_pNewTabsInBackground)
#: tabs/tabsoptions.ui:141
#, kde-format
msgid "O&pen new tabs in the background"
msgstr "Otvori nove kartice u po&zadini"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, m_pOpenAfterCurrentPage)
#: tabs/tabsoptions.ui:148
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"This will open a new tab opened from a page after the current tab, instead "
"of after the last tab."
msgstr "Nova kartica otvorena sa stranice otvorit će se iza trenutačne kartice, a ne iza posljednje."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, m_pOpenAfterCurrentPage)
#: tabs/tabsoptions.ui:151
#, kde-format
msgid "Open &new tab after current tab"
msgstr "Otvori &novu karticu iza trenutačne"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QCheckBox, m_newTabEmpty)
#: tabs/tabsoptions.ui:158
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<html><head/><body><p>Whether to leave the new tab empty or not. If this is "
"unchecked, the new tab will load the same URL loaded when creating a new "
"window</p></body></html>"
msgstr "<html><head/><body><p>Određuje hoće li nova kartica ostati prazna. Ako ova mogućnost nije označena, nova kartica učitat će isti URL koji se učitava pri stvaranju novog prozora.</p></body></html>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, m_newTabEmpty)
#: tabs/tabsoptions.ui:161
#, kde-format
msgid "Leave new tab empty"
msgstr "Ostavi novu karticu praznom"

#. i18n: ectx: property (title), widget (QGroupBox, groupBox_3)
#: tabs/tabsoptions.ui:171
#, kde-format
msgid "Closing"
msgstr "Zatvaranje"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, m_pPermanentCloseButton)
#: tabs/tabsoptions.ui:177
#, kde-format
msgid "This will display close buttons inside each tab."
msgstr "Time će se u svakoj kartici prikazati gumb za zatvaranje."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, m_pPermanentCloseButton)
#: tabs/tabsoptions.ui:180
#, kde-format
msgid "&Show close button on tabs"
msgstr "Prikaži gumb za zatvaranje na &karticama"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, m_pMiddleClickClose)
#: tabs/tabsoptions.ui:187
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"When you click on a tab using the middle mouse button or mouse wheel, it "
"will close that tab."
msgstr "Klikom srednje tipke miša ili kotačića miša na karticu zatvorit će se ta kartica."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, m_pMiddleClickClose)
#: tabs/tabsoptions.ui:190
#, kde-format
msgid "Middle-click on a tab to close it"
msgstr "Zatvori karticu klikom srednje tipke miša"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, m_pTabConfirm)
#: tabs/tabsoptions.ui:197
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"This will ask you whether you are sure you want to close a window when it "
"has multiple tabs opened in it."
msgstr "Prikazat će se upit za potvrdu zatvaranja prozora s više otvorenih kartica."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, m_pTabConfirm)
#: tabs/tabsoptions.ui:200
#, kde-format
msgid "Confirm &when closing windows with multiple tabs"
msgstr "Zatraži potvrdu pri zatvaranju prozora s više kartica"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, m_pTabCloseActivatePrevious)
#: tabs/tabsoptions.ui:207
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"When checking this the previous used or opened tab will be activated when "
"you close the current active tab instead of the one right to the current tab."
msgstr "Ako je ovo označeno, zatvaranjem trenutačne aktivne kartice aktivirat će se prethodno korištena ili otvorena kartica umjesto kartice odmah desno od trenutačne."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, m_pTabCloseActivatePrevious)
#: tabs/tabsoptions.ui:210
#, kde-format
msgid "Activate previously used tab when closing the current tab"
msgstr "Pri zatvaranju trenutačne kartice aktiviraj prethodno korištenu karticu"

